{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_1_level_main_01-04_beg",
  "groupId": "main_1",
  "stageId": "main_01-04",
  "title": "先兆",
  "storyCode": "1-4",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_01-04_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "89443faee2c5aad7d2b019ae13755746268d22f00bde005fde7b2402b3c2a324",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第九关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "呼......甩開他們了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "按這個速度，我們很快就會離開中城區，抵達南面出口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "周圍也變得越來越嘈雜......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "可能是切爾諾伯格的居民想要逃出城市，反而和整合運動發生了衝突吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "似乎有幾個城區已經撤離了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "而沒來得及逃出切爾諾伯格的本地居民，卻依然被整合運動攔在這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "這個開闊區域，曾經是個大廣場吧。如今......只剩下些廢墟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "虐待感染者的城市，遭到了感染者的報復嗎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "你似乎——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "很有感觸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "呵，曾經......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "天色......越來越暗淡了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "好像連空氣中......都彌漫著一股......燃燒的味道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "平民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們在幹什麼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "平民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......啊啊！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "————!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "平民？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "聽不到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "——這個距離，沒法確認身份。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "整合運動在攻擊他們——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "在這種地形沒有優勢。我們沒有能力去顧及他人的生命安全。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "生命很寶貴，阿米婭。每個人的，都很寶貴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "————"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "不管怎麼樣都來不及了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "畢竟我們已經有更大的麻煩找上了門。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "不好的事情還是發生了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "————"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "——————殺了他們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "開闊區各個出口同時出現大量整合運動！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "準備作戰！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
